<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- TarifitLS</book>
  <para style="h">Filimun</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fil</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filimun</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ṯabrat n arrasul Bulus ɣar Filimun</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ṯabrat n arrasul Bulus ɣar Filimun<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯanita ḏ ijjen n ṯebrat iy yuri arrasul Bulus ɣar umeddukeȓ nnes Filimun ƹlaḥsab ij uḥenjir qqaren-as Wanisamu. Wanisamu-ya tuɣaṯ qbeȓ ḏ lƹabd n Filimun. Yarweȓ zi Filimun u menbaƹd issen-iṯ arrasul Bulus ḏi ȓeḥbes, iḏweȓ Wanisamu ḏ ȓmumen. Uȓa ḏ Filimun tuɣa iḏweȓ ḏ ȓmumen x ufus n Bulus. Ȓexxu arrasul Bulus issekk-d Wanisamu ɣar Filimun bac aḏ mṣeȓḥan jarasen am wawmaṯen ḏi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ.</char></note></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="s">Lmuqaddima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Nec ḏ Bulus aqayi ḏ ameḥbus ƹlaḥsab Ƹisa Lmasiḥ akiḏi umaṯneɣ Timutawus. <char style="it">Tariɣ ṯabrat-a</char> i Filimun iǧan ḏ amƹacar nneɣ iy xaneɣ iƹizzen, <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />ḏ učmaṯneɣ Ƹabya ḏ <char style="it">umaṯneɣ</char> Arkippus wenni iy kiḏneɣ itemƹacaren am yijjen n umjaheḏ, u ƹaweḏ ḏ jmaƹṯ n ȓmuminin itmunan ḏi ṯeddarṯ nnec.<verse eid="PHM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Akiḏwem yiȓi arḍa ḏ ȓehna zi Arebbi Babaṯneɣ ḏ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ Siḏiṯneɣ.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ṭṭaleb n arrasul Bulus ɣar Filimun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Ȓebda tcekkareɣ Arebbi inu xmi tfekkareɣ ḏayec ḏi ṯẓaǧiṯ inu. <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />Qa nec tesȓiɣ x lʼiman nnec iy ḏayec zi Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa ḏ ȓemḥibbeṯ nnec ɣar marra ṣṣaliḥin. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />Tettareɣ i Arebbi x ṯemƹacarṯ nneɣ ḏi lʼiman ac ṯawi ɣar yijjen n ȓefhameṯ ṯekmaȓ x kuȓ ṯamesȓayṯ ṯaṣebḥant ig iǧan ɣarneɣ ḏi Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Ay uma, ȓemḥibbeṯ iy ɣarec cek ticc-ayi-d ijjen n ȓefraḥeṯ ḏ ucejjaƹ ḏ ameqqran minzi cek ṯsiḥemmiḏ uȓawen n ṣṣaliḥin.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Iḏen, min itxeṣṣan aḏ teggeḏ zemmareɣ nec ac amareɣ s zƹameṯ ḏi Lmasiḥ aṯ teggeḏ, <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />walakin ḥsen ac ttareɣ manaya s ȓemḥibbeṯ. Iwa nec ḏ Bulus aqayi numɣareɣ, ȓexxu aqayi ƹaweḏ ḏi ȓeḥbes ƹlaḥsab Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa. <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />Tettareɣ-cek x Wanisamu wenni iǧan am memmi, arriɣ-ṯ nec ḏ mmi wami tuɣaṯ akiḏi ḏi ȓeḥbes. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Qbeȓ i manaya tuɣa netta war c ineffeƹ ca, ȓexxu iḏweȓ aḏaneɣ ineffeƹ nec ḏ cek.<verse eid="PHM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Aqa nec tarriɣ-ac-ṯ-iḏ axmi ɣa c d ssekkeɣ uȓ inu. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Mecḥaȓ nec tuɣa rezzuɣ akiḏi iqqim ḏanita aḏayi iƹawen ḏeg umcan nnec zeg wami ǧiɣ ḏanita ḏi ȓeḥbes-a ƹlaḥsab Lʼinjil. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Walakin nec war xseɣ ca aḏ ggeɣ can n ȓḥajeṯ bȓa array nnec; Nec xseɣ ȓxir nnec aḏayi d yas s ȓxaḍar nnec maci s yijjen n bezzez zzayi lla. <verse eid="PHM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Netta imken x ssabab-a iy xak ifareq ḏeg yijjen n lmudda bac aɣarec d iḏweȓ ȓexxu i ȓebda. <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />Walakin ȓexxu maci am ismeɣ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ismeɣ netta ḏ lƹabd ixeddem i bab nnes bȓa tmenyaṯ.</char></note> netta ḥsen zeg ismeɣ: Am umac iy xac iƹizzen. Netta iƹizz xafi, walakin cek iƹizz xac ktar: <char style="it">ḏi ȓxeḏmeṯ</char> u ƹaweḏ am umac ḏi Siḏiṯneɣ.<verse eid="PHM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Falihaḏa, meȓa ṯḥesbeḏ-ayi ḏ amƹacar nnec, qbeȓ-iṯ axmi ḏayi ṯqebȓeḏ nec. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Meȓa iḍȓem-ic ḏi ca n ṯamesȓayṯ niɣ meȓa ḏinni can n umarwas jarawem, ḥseb-iṯ xafi nec. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Qa nec ḏ Bulus tariɣ manaya s ufus inu: Aḏac ṯ xeǧseɣ nec. Bȓa ma aḏac iniɣ qa ttarseɣ-ac uȓa ḏ ṯuḏarṯ nnec. <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Wah ay uma, xseɣ azzayek rebḥeɣ ijjen n nnfaƹ ḏi Siḏiṯneɣ, siḥma-ayi uȓ inu ḏi Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="PHM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Nec tʼakkadeɣ s ṭṭaƹa nnec, s manaya tariɣ-ac-d <char style="it">ṯabrat-a</char> ssneɣ cek aḏ teggeḏ ktar zi min ḏac tṭalabeɣ.<verse eid="PHM 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />U ƹaweḏ sewjeḏ-ayi ijjen n ṯɣurfat, tmenniɣ aɣarwem d ƹeqbeɣ ƹlaḥsab ṯẓaǧiṯ nwem.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lxitam n ṯebrat-a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Isawwaḍ-ac-d sȓam Pafras wenni iy kiḏi iǧan ḏ ameḥbus ƹlaḥsab Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" /><char style="it">Sawwaḍen-ac-d sȓam</char> ƹaweḏ Marqus ḏ Aristarxus ḏ Dimas ḏ Luqa iǧan marra ḏ imƹacaren inu.<verse eid="PHM 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Aḏ yiȓi ak arruḥ nwem arḍa n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>